#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/cargo-c.xml:105
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of cargo-c"
msgstr "Instalação do cargo-c"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/cargo-c.xml:108
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"First, download a file to ensure that <command>cargo</command> uses the "
"dependency versions specified by the upstream developers when this cargo-c "
"version (&cargo-c-version;) was released.  Without this, the latest versions"
" of the dependencies would be used and they might cause breakages:"
msgstr ""
"Primeiro, baixe um arquivo para garantir que <command>cargo</command> use as"
" versões de dependência especificadas pelos(as) desenvolvedores(as) do fluxo"
" de desenvolvimento quando essa versão cargo-c (&cargo-c-version;) foi "
"lançada. Sem isso, as versões mais recentes das dependências seriam usadas e"
" elas poderiam causar quebras:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/cargo-c.xml:115
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>curl -fLO https://github.com/lu-"
"zero/cargo-c/releases/download/v&cargo-c-version;/Cargo.lock</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>curl -fLO https://github.com/lu-"
"zero/cargo-c/releases/download/v&cargo-c-version;/Cargo.lock</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/cargo-c.xml:119
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Normally we would put such a download into an <quote>Additional "
"Downloads</quote> section. But in this case we cannot tell the package name "
"and version from the file name <filename>Cargo.lock</filename>, so it's "
"better not to put the ambiguously-named file outside the <filename "
"class='directory'>cargo-c-&cargo-c-version;</filename> directory.  We use "
"<command>curl</command> here because the <xref linkend='curl'/> package "
"should have been installed as a required dependency of <xref "
"linkend='rust'/>."
msgstr ""
"Normalmente, nós colocaríamos essa transferência em uma seção "
"<quote>Transferências Adicionais</quote>. Mas, nesse caso, não podemos dizer"
" o nome e a versão do pacote a partir do nome do arquivo "
"<filename>Cargo.lock</filename>, de forma que é melhor não colocar o arquivo"
" ambiguamente nomeado fora do diretório <filename "
"class='directory'>cargo-c-&cargo-c-version;</filename>. Nós usamos "
"<command>curl</command> aqui porque o pacote <xref linkend='curl'/> deveria "
"ter sido instalado como uma dependência exigida do <xref linkend='rust'/>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/cargo-c.xml:131
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The md5sum of the file should be <literal>&cargoc-lock-md5sum;</literal>."
msgstr ""
"A soma de verificação MD5 do arquivo deveria ser <literal>&cargoc-lock-"
"md5sum;</literal>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/cargo-c.xml:137
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>cargo-c</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>cargo-c</application> executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/cargo-c.xml:141
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>[ ! -e /usr/include/libssh2.h ] || export LIBSSH2_SYS_USE_PKG_CONFIG=1    &amp;&amp;\n"
"[ ! -e /usr/include/sqlite3.h ] || export LIBSQLITE3_SYS_USE_PKG_CONFIG=1 &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cargo build --release</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>[ ! -e /usr/include/libssh2.h ] || export LIBSSH2_SYS_USE_PKG_CONFIG=1    &amp;&amp;\n"
"[ ! -e /usr/include/sqlite3.h ] || export LIBSQLITE3_SYS_USE_PKG_CONFIG=1 &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cargo build --release</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/cargo-c.xml:147
#, xml-text
msgid "To test the results, issue: <command>cargo test --release</command>."
msgstr ""
"Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>cargo test --release</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/cargo-c.xml:151
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/cargo-c.xml:154
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -vm755 target/release/cargo-{capi,cbuild,cinstall,ctest} "
"/usr/bin/</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -vm755 target/release/cargo-{capi,cbuild,cinstall,ctest} "
"/usr/bin/</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/cargo-c.xml:157
#, xml-text
msgid "Finally, unset the exported environment variables:"
msgstr "Finalmente, desconfigure as variáveis exportadas de ambiente:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/cargo-c.xml:160
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>unset LIB{SSH2,SQLITE3}_SYS_USE_PKG_CONFIG</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>unset LIB{SSH2,SQLITE3}_SYS_USE_PKG_CONFIG</userinput>"

